  "body": "*Estimated Completion Date: April 2027*\r\n\r\nFantastic news, our Zero Deposit + $10K Cashback* offer has been extended! **For a limited time**, buyers can secure a brand-new Wolfbrook home with **Zero Deposit*** needed upfront and enjoy **$10K Cashback***.\r\n\r\nWhether you're buying your first home, your next home, or investing in property, there's zero reasons to wait. **Offer ends 30 November**. *T&Cs apply.\r\n\r\nPresenting 22 Colchester Avenue, Glendowie. A sleek new release of **seven architecturally designed homes,** offering refined suburban living just minutes from stunning beaches. This listing features the **three-bedroom homes,** each with **two bathrooms,** an **internal-access garage,** and an **additional off-street car park** — providing secure parking and valuable extra storage.\r\n\r\nDesigned for modern lifestyles, these homes strike the perfect balance between comfort and functionality. Generous proportions and intelligently planned layouts create a seamless flow throughout, while quality materials and durable finishes ensure lasting appeal. Contemporary kitchens form the heart of each home, effortlessly connecting to light-filled living spaces and private outdoor areas ideal for entertaining or unwinding.\r\n\r\nPerfect for first home buyers, growing families, and investors alike, 22 Colchester Avenue presents an outstanding opportunity to secure a beautifully crafted, brand-new home in a desirable neighbourhood.\r\n\r\n**The Location**\r\n> Positioned in the heart of **Glendowie**, just minutes from beaches, boutique shops, cafes, parks, and scenic reserves\r\n> Walking distance to **Churchill Park, Glendowie Park,** and **Crossfield Reserve**, with tennis, bowls, baseball, and walking trails\r\n> Zoned for **Glendowie School** and **Glendowie College**, with **Sacred Heart College** close by\r\n> Short drive to Karaka Bay, St Heliers Beach, Achilles Point, and the **St Heliers** village\r\n> Close to Glen Innes, Eastridge and Meadowbank Shopping Centres, Mission Bay, and **Auckland CBD**\r\n\r\n**Why Wolfbrook?**\r\nAs one of New Zealand's premier property developers, Wolfbrook Residential excels in delivering top-tier, tailor-made homes for homeowners and investors alike. Our track record speaks of our commitment to quality and craftsmanship. We understand that each property demands a unique approach. Wolfbrook goes beyond mere construction; we partner with you to achieve your financial goals and unlock the path to financial freedom.\r\n\r\n**Considering adding to your property portfolio?** As well as offering great tenant appeal, each home delivers an impressive gross rental yield – making it one of the smartest, turnkey buys available right now. Plus, Wolfbrook offers a ***2 Year Rental Guarantee**** when you choose to have your property professionally managed by us — giving you even greater peace of mind from day one.\r\n\r\n**Want a closer look at a completed Wolfbrook home?** Visit our Auckland showhomes at 1/15 Line Road, Glen Innes, open every Saturday from 11 am–1 pm, or 6 Flavia Close every Monday, Wednesday, Friday and Sunday from 11 am-12pm.\r\n\r\nIt's a great chance to explore the quality craftsmanship and thoughtful design that defines a Wolfbrook home. Take a walk through the finished space, meet our friendly team, and imagine what your future home could look like. We'd love to welcome you!\r\n\r\n*T&C's apply please visit https://wolfbrook.co.nz/resources/terms-conditions-zero-deposit-10k-cashback-offer",
